{"type":"assistant","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Commit\n\n`69ce839438b4a3bc4adcc04814ced68e5195230e`\n\n## Line count\n\n| | Lines |\n|---|------:|\n| Before | 338 |\n| After | 335 |\n\n## Gates\n\n| Gate | Result |\n|------|--------|\n| `cargo fmt --check` | pass |\n| `cargo clippy --all-targets -- -D warnings` | pass |\n| `cargo test --test budgets` ×3 | 6 passed each (~2.79s, ~2.54s, ~1.81s) |\n\n## Changes (summary)\n\n- `WATCH_BUDGET_MS` and `MODELS_BUDGET_MS` set to 50ms with the requested floor comments.\n- SLOW fake writes `agent.pid`; RSS test waits on it, logs `supervisor rss: {kb}KB`, and asserts with KB in the message.\n- Cancel test calls `cleanup_fake_children()` to SIGKILL any leftover grandchild/agent PIDs.\n- `Env::new(name, script)` replaces `new_info`; doctor/models share one table-driven test with per-command failure text via `assert_wall_ms`.\n\n## Friction\n\n- Clippy `collapsible_if` required chaining `let` conditions in `cleanup_fake_children`.\n- A single table row per wall-clock case failed to compile because each closure has a distinct type; doctor/models share one loop with an `if cmd == \"doctor\"` branch instead.\n- none\n\nSTATUS: DONE"}]},"session_id":"23269ead-5209-4ac9-9976-6eab6d468682"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","duration_ms":77301,"duration_api_ms":77301,"is_error":false,"result":"Implementing the requested changes in `tests/budgets.rs`.\n\n\n## Commit\n\n`69ce839438b4a3bc4adcc04814ced68e5195230e`\n\n## Line count\n\n| | Lines |\n|---|------:|\n| Before | 338 |\n| After | 335 |\n\n## Gates\n\n| Gate | Result |\n|------|--------|\n| `cargo fmt --check` | pass |\n| `cargo clippy --all-targets -- -D warnings` | pass |\n| `cargo test --test budgets` ×3 | 6 passed each (~2.79s, ~2.54s, ~1.81s) |\n\n## Changes (summary)\n\n- `WATCH_BUDGET_MS` and `MODELS_BUDGET_MS` set to 50ms with the requested floor comments.\n- SLOW fake writes `agent.pid`; RSS test waits on it, logs `supervisor rss: {kb}KB`, and asserts with KB in the message.\n- Cancel test calls `cleanup_fake_children()` to SIGKILL any leftover grandchild/agent PIDs.\n- `Env::new(name, script)` replaces `new_info`; doctor/models share one table-driven test with per-command failure text via `assert_wall_ms`.\n\n## Friction\n\n- Clippy `collapsible_if` required chaining `let` conditions in `cleanup_fake_children`.\n- A single table row per wall-clock case failed to compile because each closure has a distinct type; doctor/models share one loop with an `if cmd == \"doctor\"` branch instead.\n- none\n\nSTATUS: DONE","session_id":"23269ead-5209-4ac9-9976-6eab6d468682","request_id":"b1909a7c-c8ec-40fc-8efd-94b4075c7b65","usage":{"inputTokens":11895,"outputTokens":6597,"cacheReadTokens":644839,"cacheWriteTokens":0}}
